---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Cancellation Policy"
  description="Learn how to change or cancel a LUMÈRA LUXE order, when a courier fee may apply, and how prepaid refunds work."
  intro="How to change or cancel an order, when a courier fee may apply, and when to expect a refund."
  links={[
    { id: 'before-dispatch', label: 'Before dispatch' },
    { id: 'after-dispatch', label: 'After dispatch' },
    { id: 'bulk-orders', label: 'Bulk orders' },
    { id: 'prepaid-refunds', label: 'Prepaid refunds' }
  ]}
  contact={{
    title: "Need to change or cancel an order?",
    text: "Message us as soon as possible and include the name on your order.",
    message: "Hello LUMÈRA LUXE, I would like to modify or cancel an order request."
  }}
>
  <section id="before-dispatch">
    <h2>Before dispatch</h2>
    <p>
      You can change or cancel a standard order <strong>for free</strong> before we hand it to the courier. Corporate and bulk orders have a separate deadline below.
    </p>
    <p>
      Message us on WhatsApp at <a class="policy-link" href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.whatsappNumber}`}>{siteConfig.whatsappDisplay}</a> with the name on your order. We’ll cancel it right away and confirm in writing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="after-dispatch">
    <h2>After dispatch</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Reschedule delivery.</strong> If your plans change while the courier is on the way, message us right away so we can arrange another delivery time.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Decline delivery.</strong> You can decline the sealed parcel at your door. If the bottle is still in perfect condition, you won’t pay for the perfume. A courier fee of <strong>25–30 QAR</strong> may apply to cover the trip.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="bulk-orders">
    <h2>Corporate and bulk orders</h2>
    <p>
      For corporate orders or reservations for multiple bottles, tell us you want to cancel at least <strong>12 hours before the scheduled dispatch time</strong>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="prepaid-refunds">
    <h2>Refunds for prepaid orders</h2>
    <p>
      If you paid in advance by corporate bank transfer (QNB) or Fawran and then cancelled, we’ll refund the bank account you paid from within <strong>24–48 business hours</strong> after our accounting team verifies the details.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>
